{"id":"a01ce7343b132090","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md","title":"Lusin Set","display":"df-lusin-set — Lusin Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lusin-set","aliases":["58-df-lusin-set"],"display":"df-lusin-set — Lusin Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-continuum]]","[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lusin-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lusin-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lusin-set — Lusin Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"58-df-continuum\">58-df-continuum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-meager.md\">../batch04/58-df-meager.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 是标准实拓扑（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c\\)</span>（连续统基数，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"58-df-continuum\">58-df-continuum</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-meager.md\">../batch04/58-df-meager.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(L,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\\land L\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land|L|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall M\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;(\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(L\\cap M))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(L,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\\land L\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land|L|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall M\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;(\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(L\\cap M))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Lusin set is uncountable but meets every meager subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> in only countably many points.</li>\n<li>CH implies the existence of a Lusin set; its existence is not provable in ZFC alone.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-continuum","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuum]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathbb R$ 且 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)$ 是标准实拓扑（see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuum","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak c$（连续统基数，see [[58-df-continuum]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-meager.md","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$（see [[../batch04/58-df-meager.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)$（see [[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lusin-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(L,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R)\\land L\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land|L|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall M\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;(\\mathrm{Meager}(M,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(L\\cap M))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[{"id":"d08bb83a29b082b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LusinSet}_S(E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (Lusin-set predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-804","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-lusin-set.md|58-df-lusin-set]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["99c5552e170feee3","d816c9cae96d1191","1b3610e6aed65b25","e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}